This project began as a fork of the original MultiTwitch project by Brian
Hamrick (https://github.com/bhamrick/multitwitch). That project ships no formal
license file, but its README grants use in these words:

    "The code of this project is free to use."

The frontend has since been substantially rewritten (direct HLS playback via
Streamlink and hls.js in place of the official Twitch embed, plus new layout,
sync, chat, and Twitch-integration code). The MIT License above applies to this
fork's own code; any surviving original portions remain used under the upstream
grant quoted above. As a courtesy, the original project is credited via a link
in the splash screen.

